DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_D2B8_8159';
<p>d2b8_8159</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #646108;">Gene B</span></strong> is associated with the '<span style="color: #646108;"><i>bumpy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #646108;">Gene B</span> has a skin texture that is not smooth, but rough with small bumps all over.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #086594;">Gene H</span></strong> is analogous to the '<span style="color: #086594;"><i>horsey</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #086594;">Gene H</span> is quite big and strong-looking, much larger than your typical fruit fly.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #8a378a;">Gene P</span></strong> is linked with the '<span style="color: #8a378a;"><i>prickly</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #8a378a;">Gene P</span> is covered with sharp bristles, giving it a spiky texture.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">bumpy, horsey, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f1edba; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d9edff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">h</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffdffa; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">1,159</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">bumpy, horsey</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f1edba; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d9edff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">h</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8a378a;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">312</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">bumpy, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f1edba; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #086594;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffdffa; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">6,428</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">bumpy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f1edba; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #086594;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8a378a;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">2,063</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">horsey, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #646108;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d9edff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">h</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffdffa; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">2,060</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">horsey</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #646108;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d9edff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">h</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8a378a;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">6,527</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #646108;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #086594;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffdffa; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">319</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #646108;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #086594;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8a378a;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">1,132</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">20,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>B</b> and <b>P</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>B</b> and <b>P</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_D2B8_8159
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_D2B8_8159_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(1,132 + 1,159 + 2,060 + 2,063)</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = <sup>6,414</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = 0.3207 = <strong>32.07 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D2B8_8159_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_D2B8_8159_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(312 + 319 + 1,132 + 1,159)</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = <sup>2,922</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = 0.1461 = <strong>14.61 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D2B8_8159_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_D2B8_8159_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(312 + 319 + 1,159 + 6,428)</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = <sup>8,218</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = 0.4109 = <strong>41.09 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D2B8_8159_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_D2B8_8159_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(312 + 319 + 2,060 + 2,063)</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = <sup>4,754</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = 0.2377 = <strong>23.77 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D2B8_8159_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_D2B8_8159_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(319 + 1,159 + 2,063 + 6,527)</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = <sup>10,068</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = 0.5034 = <strong>50.34 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D2B8_8159_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_D2B8_8159_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(6,428 + 6,527)</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = <sup>12,955</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = 0.6478 = <strong>64.78 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D2B8_8159_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_D2B8_8159_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(312 + 319 + 2,060 + 2,063)</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = <sup>4,754</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = 0.2377 = <strong>23.77 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D2B8_8159_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
